SUMMARY:Élise Devey - A Frank–Wolfe-Type Algorithm for High-Dimensional 
 Stochastic Control Problems with Non-Exchangeable Agents
DESCRIPTION:Abstract : This paper presents a Frank--Wolfe type algorithm fo
 r computing approximately optimal distributed stochastic controls in a lar
 ge population of $N$ agents cooperating to minimize a convex cost function
 al. The cost includes a heterogeneous pairwise interaction term between th
 e agents' controls\, which rules out a direct treatment by the classical M
 ean Field Control framework. Working…\nhttps://indico.math.cnrs.fr/event
 /16986/
